# teams-service component. VERSION is bumped by hand when the behaviour changes.
VERSION=0.1.0
# PocketBase (https://github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase, MIT) is built from source with the migrations of
# pocketbase/ compiled in. The version is pinned here AND by pocketbase/go.mod; every module it needs is
# pinned by sha256 in pocketbase/go.sum, which `go build -mod=readonly` verifies (the build asserts the
# version below equals go.mod's and that go.sum holds the checksum of that version).
POCKETBASE_VERSION=0.38.2
# The Go toolchain image that builds it. Only the binary reaches the component, so this is the image's
# own pin, moved by hand: a weekly bump of the shared pins does not republish this image.
GO_IMAGE=golang:1.25-bookworm@sha256:3b4a11519ad929d1e1d261a12cff056f0c85b735253d7d861346b9c6f8b36437
